WEBVTT

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.576
France and Germany are similar.

00:05:31.243 --> 00:05:32.578
In contrast,

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.707
the long-hours countries
like the UK and Italy

00:05:36.707 --> 00:05:39.668
have much, much lower productivity.

00:05:40.169 --> 00:05:43.839
The US historically
led the world in productivity

00:05:43.881 --> 00:05:48.177
and would likely do better now
if its work time weren't so high.

00:05:48.594 --> 00:05:51.680
While tech firms comprise
the biggest group

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:55.142
adopting four-day reduced hours schedules,

00:05:55.184 --> 00:05:58.354
companies are also
making the switch in banking,

00:05:58.396 --> 00:06:00.856
PR, marketing and design,